  "notes": "{苦痛|くつう} refers to significant physical or mental pain.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {苦痛|くつう}を{感|かん}じる (to feel pain)\n- {苦痛|くつう}を{与|あた}える (to cause pain)\n- {苦痛|くつう}に{耐|た}える (to endure suffering)\n- {苦痛|くつう}から{逃|のが}れる (to escape from pain)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {苦痛|くつう}: pain, suffering (strong, formal)\n- {痛|いた}み: pain (physical, general)\n- {苦|くる}しみ: suffering (emotional/physical)\n- {辛|つら}さ: hardship, difficulty",
